From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antonin Tomecek <antonin@jupiter.localdomain>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libalpm: name config backup files .luxnew and .luxsave

LuxOS: the package manager is lux, so files kept by libalpm next to
changed configuration files are named after it instead of pacman:
.pacnew -> .luxnew (new version of a file the user changed) and
.pacsave -> .luxsave (changed file of a removed package), including
numbered .luxsave.N files, messages, log lines, manual pages and the
test suite. Event names of the libalpm API (ALPM_EVENT_PACNEW_CREATED,
ALPM_EVENT_PACSAVE_CREATED) stay, so pyalpm and other users of the
library are not affected. Translations are adjusted in prepare().
---
